  "notes": "Louis Poulsen PH 5 (design Poul Henningsen, 1958): shade Ø 50 cm × H 26.7 cm, cable up to 3 m (Casa di Luce, Utility Design). The three nested shades and the red inner cone follow the classic version; the curves are simplified. Hangs from the ceiling: the 118 cm height includes the cord, so with the 255 cm ceiling the shade's bottom is 137 cm above the floor, 63 cm above a 74 cm dining table."
